Cell["\<\
Here we call the MBConicHulls.wl package, which is  in the same directory as \
the notebook . The package will internally call MultivariateResidues.m  when \
required in the intermediate steps.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8327618591952267`*^9, 3.8327619580918617`*^9}, {
