Cell["\<\
Here we have derived the analytic expression of the series number \
AppellSeriesNumber for parameter values in AppellMBGammaParaSub. As the \
values of the parameters can alter the singularity structure of the \
integrand, it is advised not to substitute them after running \
EvaluateSeries[], where the singularity analysis is done, except if one knows \
that the chosen values belong to the non-resonant class.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8327645013471346`*^9, 3.8327645101134567`*^9}, {
