62e4e249bcbb"],

Cell["\<\
We now do the same exercise for the Double Box subject to the conformal \
constraint a + b + c + l = d + e + f + l = DD and the differential equation \
constraint DD/2 - l = 1.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.83277622242523*^9, 3.8327762406485376`*^9}, {
  3.8327762799929385`*^9, 3.832776305229946*^9}, {3.8327766062672796`*^9, 
