  3.899379282403328*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0ed6c7eb-f18e-47b5-94d7-\
6e594585f599"],

Cell["\<\
We have explicitly taken into account the conformal and differential equation \
constraints in the following analysis. Therefore, to cross-check the results \
given in https://journals.aps.org/prd/abstract/10.1103/PhysRevD.102.091901 \
one can remove the differential equation constraints DiffEqConstraintHX and \
DiffEqConstraintDB, and keep generic values for the parameters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.832776776233136*^9, 3.8327768493238416`*^9}, {
  3.832777285208291*^9, 3.8327772889694457`*^9}, {3.8328122798579206`*^9, 
  3.8328122824305735`*^9}, {3.832990991526175*^9, 3.832991023541493*^9}, {
  3.8329911496094303`*^9, 3.832991189184347*^9}, {3.832991373155706*^9, 
  3.8329913742142143`*^9}, {3.8330094963471837`*^9, 3.8330095952526655`*^9}, {
  3.8330096366122627`*^9, 3.8330096871243544`*^9}, {3.833009929731677*^9, 
  3.833009937071409*^9}, {3.8330101423960752`*^9, 3.833010163461838*^9}},
 FontSize->10,
 Background->RGBColor[
  0.87, 0.94, 1],ExpressionUUID->"bbae1556-d720-494a-b28c-08f437707e3b"],

