Cell["\<\
Direct numerical integration of the Feynman parametric representation using \
the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]GlobalAdaptive\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] method of \
NIntegration with precision WorkingPrecisionHX. For better accuracy, one may \
increase MaxErrorIncreaseHX, but it will increase the computation time.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8327768854479074`*^9, 3.832776976459507*^9}, {
   3.8327770103590784`*^9, 3.8327770133996167`*^9}, {3.832777056808815*^9, 
